---
import CopyCommand from "./CopyCommand.astro";
---
<section class="section rule" id="install">
  <div class="wrap grid">
    <div class="head">
      <h2 class="h2">Up and running in three steps.</h2>
      <p class="body">You need Go, <code>gh</code> logged in, and herdr. Run the installer again after every update: it restarts the cairn already open.</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li>
        <h3 class="h3">Install</h3>
        <p class="body">The binary, the agents' skill, the push hook, and cairn's button in herdr's sidebar.</p>
        <CopyCommand id="cmd-step1" size="md" command="git clone https://github.com/Gradrien/cairn && cairn/install.sh --herdr" />
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3 class="h3">Add a repository</h3>
        <p class="body">From inside it. No option means no tracker; change anything later with <span class="kbd">s</span>.</p>
        <CopyCommand id="cmd-step2" size="md" command="cd ~/code/your-repo && cairn add" />
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3 class="h3">Plan a ticket</h3>
        <p class="body">Open cairn from herdr with <span class="nw"><span class="kbd">prefix</span> <span class="kbd">a</span></span>. <span class="nw">Press <span class="kbd">n</span></span> and type a title or a ticket number. The plan comes back to you for approval.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .grid { display: grid; gap: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem); grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
  @media (min-width: 1000px) { .grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.8fr) minmax(0, 1.2fr); } }
  .head { display: grid; gap: 1.25rem; align-content: start; }
  code { font-size: 0.92em; color: var(--fg); }
  .nw { white-space: nowrap; }
  .steps { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 0; counter-reset: s; }
  .steps li { counter-increment: s; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 3rem minmax(0, 1fr); column-gap: 1rem; row-gap: 0.6rem; padding: 1.6rem 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .steps li:first-child { border-top: 0; padding-top: 0.2rem; }
  .steps li::before { content: counter(s); grid-row: span 3; font: 500 1rem/1.3 var(--mono); color: var(--lavender); }
  .steps li > :global(*) { grid-column: 2; min-width: 0; }
</style>
